<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Burguer Chefes Espeto | Cotia - SP</title>
<meta name="description" content="Hambúrgueres artesanais, porções e bebidas em Cotia - SP. Peça agora pelo WhatsApp.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#150907;
    --panel:#221310;
    --panel-2:#2b1815;
    --line-ink:#0c0503;
    --cream:#fff5e6;
    --cream-dim:#e3cdb4;
    --red:#ff2438;
    --red-deep:#c4101f;
    --gold:#ffc93c;
    --gold-deep:#f0a30f;
    --green:#22c95c;
    --shadow-hard: 6px 6px 0 var(--line-ink);
    --shadow-hard-sm: 4px 4px 0 var(--line-ink);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--cream);
    font-family:'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    line-height:0.98;
    margin:0;
  }
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  ul{margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;}
  section{position:relative;}

  .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(22px); transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}

  /* ---------- angled dividers ---------- */
  .zig-top{position:absolute; top:-1px; left:0; right:0; height:46px; overflow:hidden; line-height:0;}
  .zig-bottom{position:absolute; bottom:-1px; left:0; right:0; height:46px; overflow:hidden; line-height:0; transform:rotate(180deg);}
  .zig-top svg, .zig-bottom svg{width:100%; height:100%; display:block;}

  /* ---------- HEADER ---------- */
  header{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    background:var(--ink);
    border-bottom:4px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .nav{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:12px 24px; max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto;
  }
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:'Anton',sans-serif; font-size:1.2rem; letter-spacing:0.02em; color:var(--cream);}
  .brand-flame{font-size:1.5rem;}
  .brand span{color:var(--red); -webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--gold); text-stroke:1px var(--gold);}
  .nav-links{display:flex; gap:26px; align-items:center;}
  .nav-links a{
    font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0.02em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--cream); transition:color .2s ease;
    padding:6px 0;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--gold);}
  .nav-cta{
    background:var(--green);
    color:var(--line-ink) !important; padding:10px 22px; border-radius:100px;
    font-weight:900 !important; font-size:0.85rem !important; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center;
    border:3px solid var(--line-ink);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard-sm);
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{transform:translate(2px,2px); box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--line-ink); color:var(--line-ink) !important;}
  .burger-btn{display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; background:none; border:none; padding:6px;}
  .burger-btn span{width:24px; height:3px; background:var(--gold); border-radius:2px;}
  .mobile-menu{
    display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:0; background:var(--panel);
    border-top:3px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .mobile-menu a{padding:16px 24px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:0.9rem;}
  .mobile-menu.open{display:flex;}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:150px 0 110px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 20%, rgba(255,36,56,0.4), transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 8% 90%, rgba(255,201,60,0.22), transparent 45%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0 3px, transparent 3px 34px),
      var(--ink);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero .wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr; gap:50px; align-items:center; position:relative;}
  .kicker{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    background:var(--gold); color:var(--line-ink); border:3px solid var(--line-ink);
    font-weight:900; font-size:0.78rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    margin-bottom:20px; padding:7px 16px; border-radius:100px; transform:rotate(-2deg);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard-sm);
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 5.6vw, 4.3rem);
    color:var(--cream);
    text-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:normal;
    color:var(--gold);
    -webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--line-ink);
    text-stroke:2px var(--line-ink);
    position:relative;
    display:inline-block;
  }
  .hero p.lead{
    margin-top:24px; font-size:1.15rem; color:var(--cream-dim); max-width:480px; font-weight:500;
  }
  .hero-ctas{display:flex; gap:18px; margin-top:38px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    padding:17px 30px; border-radius:100px; font-weight:900; font-size:0.98rem;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.01em;
    border:3px solid var(--line-ink);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard);
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translate(3px,3px); box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--line-ink);}
  .btn:active{transform:translate(6px,6px); box-shadow:0 0 0 var(--line-ink);}
  .btn-primary{ background:var(--green); color:var(--line-ink); }
  .btn-ghost{ background:var(--cream); color:var(--line-ink); }
  .btn-red{ background:var(--red); color:#fff; }
  .btn-gold{ background:var(--gold); color:var(--line-ink); }

  .hero-visual{position:relative;}
  .plate-glow{
    position:absolute; inset:-10% -14%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,201,60,0.4), transparent 62%);
    filter:blur(24px); z-index:0;
  }
  .hero-visual img{
    position:relative; z-index:1;
    border-radius:24px;
    border:5px solid var(--line-ink);
    box-shadow:10px 10px 0 var(--red), 10px 10px 0 4px var(--line-ink);
    animation:float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes float{
    0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-1deg);}
    50%{transform:translateY(-14px) rotate(1deg);}
  }
  .price-chip{
    position:absolute; z-index:3; bottom:-22px; left:-20px;
    background:var(--red); color:#fff; padding:14px 22px; border-radius:16px;
    font-family:'Anton',sans-serif; text-transform:none;
    border:4px solid var(--line-ink);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard);
    transform:rotate(-6deg);
  }
  .price-chip small{display:block; font-family:'Work Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:0.68rem; letter-spacing:0.05em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.9;}
  .price-chip strong{font-size:1.6rem; color:var(--gold);}
  .spark{position:absolute; font-size:1.8rem; z-index:2; filter:drop-shadow(2px 2px 0 var(--line-ink));}
  .spark.s1{top:6%; right:2%;}
  .spark.s2{bottom:14%; left:-4%;}

  /* ---------- SECTION HEADS ---------- */
  .sec-head{max-width:640px; margin-bottom:46px;}
  .sec-head .kicker{margin-bottom:14px;}
  .sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.9rem); color:var(--cream); text-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.35);}
  .sec-head p{color:var(--cream-dim); margin-top:16px; font-size:1.04rem;}
  .sec-head.center{margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; text-align:center;}

  /* ---------- MENU ---------- */
  .menu{padding:120px 0 100px; background:var(--panel); position:relative;}
  .menu-tabs{
    display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:46px;
  }
  .menu-tab{
    background:var(--ink); border:3px solid var(--line-ink); color:var(--cream-dim);
    font-weight:800; font-size:0.88rem; padding:11px 20px; border-radius:100px;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.01em;
    box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--line-ink);
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .menu-tab:hover{color:var(--cream);}
  .menu-tab.active{background:var(--gold); color:var(--line-ink); transform:translate(2px,2px); box-shadow:1px 1px 0 var(--line-ink);}

  .menu-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(270px,1fr)); gap:26px;
  }
  .menu-card{
    background:var(--ink);
    border:3px solid var(--line-ink);
    border-radius:18px;
    overflow:visible;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard-sm);
    transition:transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    position:relative;
  }
  .menu-card:hover{transform:translate(-3px,-3px); box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--line-ink);}
  .menu-card .thumb{height:170px; overflow:hidden; position:relative; border-radius:15px 15px 0 0; border-bottom:3px solid var(--line-ink);}
  .menu-card .thumb img{width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; transition:transform .5s ease;}
  .menu-card:hover .thumb img{transform:scale(1.08) rotate(1deg);}
  .menu-card .price-tag{
    position:absolute; top:-14px; right:14px; z-index:2;
    background:var(--red); color:#fff; font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;
    padding:8px 14px; border-radius:10px; border:3px solid var(--line-ink);
    box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--line-ink); font-size:1rem; transform:rotate(4deg);
  }
  .menu-card .body{padding:22px 18px 20px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; flex:1;}
  .menu-card .name{font-weight:800; font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--cream); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.01em;}
  .menu-card .desc{color:var(--cream-dim); font-size:0.88rem; flex:1;}
  .menu-card .order-link{
    margin-top:10px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;
    background:var(--green); color:var(--line-ink); font-weight:900; font-size:0.85rem;
    padding:11px 14px; border-radius:100px; text-transform:uppercase;
    border:3px solid var(--line-ink); box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--line-ink);
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .menu-card .order-link:hover{transform:translate(2px,2px); box-shadow:1px 1px 0 var(--line-ink);}
  .menu-card .order-link svg{width:16px; height:16px;}

  .combo-card{border-color:var(--gold-deep);}
  .combo-card .price-tag{background:var(--gold); color:var(--line-ink);}

  /* ---------- FEATURED ---------- */
  .featured{
    padding:120px 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(255,201,60,0.18), transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-deep), #7a0c17 55%, var(--ink));
    position:relative;
    border-top:6px solid var(--gold); border-bottom:6px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .featured .wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr; gap:58px; align-items:center; position:relative;}
  .featured-img{position:relative;}
  .featured-img img{border-radius:22px; border:5px solid var(--line-ink); box-shadow:10px 10px 0 var(--gold), 10px 10px 0 4px var(--line-ink);}
  .badge-star{
    position:absolute; top:-22px; right:-22px;
    background:var(--gold); color:var(--line-ink); font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;
    width:98px; height:98px; border-radius:50%;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center;
    font-size:0.88rem; line-height:1.05; padding:6px; border:4px solid var(--line-ink);
    box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--line-ink);
    transform:rotate(10deg);
  }
  .featured-content .kicker{background:var(--cream);}
  .featured-content h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.2vw,3.3rem); color:#fff; text-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);}
  .featured-content p.lead{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-top:18px; max-width:480px; font-size:1.08rem; font-weight:500;}
  .featured-list{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin:26px 0 32px;}
  .featured-list span{
    background:var(--ink); border:3px solid var(--line-ink);
    padding:8px 16px; border-radius:100px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--gold); font-weight:800;
    box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--line-ink);
  }
  .featured-price{font-family:'Anton',sans-serif; font-size:2.6rem; color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:26px; text-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--line-ink);}
  .featured-price small{font-family:'Work Sans',sans-serif; font-size:1rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-weight:700; text-transform:none;}

  /* ---------- REVIEWS ---------- */
  .reviews{padding:110px 0; background:var(--ink);}
  .rating-summary{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:24px; margin-bottom:44px; flex-wrap:wrap;
    background:var(--panel); border:3px solid var(--line-ink); border-radius:20px; padding:22px 28px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard-sm); max-width:520px;
  }
  .rating-score{
    font-family:'Anton',sans-serif; font-size:3.6rem; color:var(--gold); text-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--line-ink);
  }
  .rating-stars{color:var(--gold); font-size:1.4rem; letter-spacing:2px;}
  .rating-sub{color:var(--cream-dim); font-size:0.92rem; font-weight:600;}
  .review-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:22px;}
  .review-card{
    background:var(--panel); border:3px solid var(--line-ink); border-radius:16px; padding:26px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard-sm);
  }
  .review-card .stars{color:var(--gold); letter-spacing:2px; margin-bottom:12px; font-size:1.1rem;}
  .review-card p{color:var(--cream-dim); font-size:0.95rem; font-style:italic;}
  .review-card .who{margin-top:14px; font-weight:800; color:var(--cream); font-size:0.88rem; font-style:normal; text-transform:uppercase;}
  .review-note{
    margin-top:28px; font-size:0.86rem; color:var(--cream-dim);
    border-left:4px solid var(--gold); padding:4px 0 4px 16px;
  }

  /* ---------- LOCATION ---------- */
  .location{padding:110px 0; background:var(--panel-2); border-top:6px solid var(--red); border-bottom:6px solid var(--red);}
  .location .wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:50px; align-items:center;}
  .loc-card{
    background:var(--ink); border:3px solid var(--line-ink); border-radius:20px; padding:36px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard);
  }
  .loc-row{display:flex; gap:16px; margin-bottom:24px;}
  .loc-icon{
    width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--gold);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0; color:var(--line-ink);
    border:3px solid var(--line-ink);
  }
  .loc-row h3{font-family:'Work Sans',sans-serif; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:800; font-size:0.98rem; color:var(--cream); margin-bottom:4px; letter-spacing:0.01em;}
  .loc-row p{color:var(--cream-dim); font-size:0.93rem; margin:0;}
  .map-frame{border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; border:3px solid var(--line-ink); height:100%; min-height:340px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard);}
  .map-frame iframe{width:100%; height:100%; min-height:340px; border:0; filter:saturate(1.15) contrast(1.05);}

  /* ---------- INSTAGRAM STRIP ---------- */
  .insta{padding:90px 0 110px; background:var(--panel); text-align:center;}
  .insta-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:16px; margin-top:38px;
  }
  .insta-grid a{position:relative; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; aspect-ratio:1; border:3px solid var(--line-ink); box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard-sm);}
  .insta-grid img{width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; transition:transform .4s ease;}
  .insta-grid a::after{
    content:"📷"; position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background:rgba(255,36,56,0.55); opacity:0; transition:opacity .3s ease; font-size:1.6rem;
  }
  .insta-grid a:hover::after{opacity:1;}
  .insta-grid a:hover img{transform:scale(1.1);}

  /* ---------- CONTACT / FOOTER ---------- */
  .contact-cta{
    padding:100px 0; text-align:center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(255,36,56,0.4), transparent 55%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0 3px, transparent 3px 30px),
      var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-cta h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,3.2rem); margin-bottom:20px; color:var(--cream); text-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);}
  .contact-cta p{color:var(--cream-dim); max-width:520px; margin:0 auto 36px; font-size:1.08rem; font-weight:500;}
  .contact-methods{display:flex; gap:18px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  footer{background:var(--panel); border-top:5px solid var(--gold); padding:60px 0 30px;}
  .foot-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap:40px; margin-bottom:44px;}
  .foot-brand{font-family:'Anton',sans-serif; font-size:1.35rem; margin-bottom:12px; color:var(--cream);}
  .foot-brand span{color:var(--red);}
  footer p{color:var(--cream-dim); font-size:0.9rem;}
  .foot-col h4{font-size:0.84rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em; color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:16px; font-weight:800;}
  .foot-col ul li{margin-bottom:11px;}
  .foot-col a{color:var(--cream-dim); font-size:0.93rem; transition:color .2s ease; font-weight:600;}
  .foot-col a:hover{color:var(--gold);}
  .foot-bottom{
    border-top:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top:26px;
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;
    color:var(--cream-dim); font-size:0.82rem;
  }

  /* WhatsApp float button */
  .wa-float{
    position:fixed; bottom:26px; right:26px; z-index:200;
    width:64px; height:64px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--green);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    border:4px solid var(--line-ink);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-hard);
  }
  .wa-float:hover{transform:translate(2px,2px); box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--line-ink);}
  .wa-float::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; inset:-8px; border-radius:50%;
    border:2px solid var(--green);
    animation:pulse-ring 2.4s ease-out 1;
  }
  @keyframes pulse-ring{
    0%{transform:scale(0.8); opacity:1;}
    100%{transform:scale(1.5); opacity:0;}
  }
  .wa-float svg{width:32px; height:32px; fill:var(--line-ink);}

  @media (max-width:980px){
    .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr; text-align:left;}
    .hero-visual{order:-1; max-width:420px;}
    .featured .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .location .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .insta-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .nav-links{display:none;}
    .burger-btn{display:flex;}
    .hero{padding:120px 0 60px;}
    .rating-summary{gap:16px;}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .spark{display:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="brand"><span class="brand-flame">🔥</span>Burguer <span>Chefes</span> Espeto</div>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="#cardapio">Cardápio</a>
      <a href="#destaque">Destaque</a>
      <a href="#avaliacoes">Avaliações</a>
      <a href="#local">Onde estamos</a>
      <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="https://wa.me/5511939089345?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Quero%20fazer%20um%20pedido." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pedir agora</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="burger-btn" id="burgerBtn" aria-label="Abrir menu">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
    <a href="#cardapio">Cardápio</a>
    <a href="#destaque">Destaque</a>
    <a href="#avaliacoes">Avaliações</a>
    <a href="#local">Onde estamos</a>
    <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
    <a href="https://wa.me/5511939089345?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Quero%20fazer%20um%20pedido." target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--green);">Pedir pelo WhatsApp</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">Cotia - SP · Feito na hora</div>
      <h1>Seu próximo hambúrguer <em>favorito</em> está aqui.</h1>
